# ---------------------------------------------------------------- stuck in their ways (Green)

== the same cottage, nine years running
tier: inner
holds: stuck in their ways
stages: young_adult, adult, mature
age: 18-50
tone: mixed
life: friends, leisure
horizon: months
roles: friend
earth: your friend found somewhere new for your yearly week away, then booked the same old cottage, because you always say no
