scene B: {N} always thought of {N} as someone who chooses. But {friend} had stopped bringing choices at all.
scene R: {N} feels a flare of hurt, and under it something worse: {friend} has a point.
scene G: The cottage, the walk, the pub on the last night. {N} loves every part of it, and never noticed {friend} going quiet.
