- R>G | go to the cottage, but stop somewhere new on the way, on a whim | v: stimulation, tradition | chance: 58
- G>W | keep the cottage, but give {friend} every other year to choose | v: tradition, universalism | chance: 52
works: The new place is strange for two days, then wonderful, and {friend} talks about it for months.
